--   theorem J6A.passGen (Aa : ℕ → (ℕ → ℤ × ℤ) → (ℕ → ℤ × ℤ)) (hst : ∀ i, s i ≤ t i)
--       (hloc : ∀ i : Fin d, ∀ U U' : ℕ → ℤ × ℤ, (∀ j < s i, U j = U' j) → Aa i U = Aa i U')
--       (L : (i : Fin d) → (ZMod (s i) → ℂ) →L[ℂ] (ZMod (t i) → ℂ)) (hLn : ∀ i, ‖L i‖ ≤ 1)
--       (ε : ℝ) (hε : 0 ≤ ε) (hA : ∀ i : Fin d, FPApprox p (Aa i) (liftL (L i)) ε)
--       (zs : List GI) (u : ((i : Fin d) → ZMod (s i)) → ℂ)
--       (hrep : RepPad p s t zs u) (hu : ‖u‖ ≤ 1 / 2) :
--       RepFull p t (tensorGo (mapsGen t Aa) (List.ofFn t) zs)
--           (wOf p t (tensorGo (mapsGen t Aa) (List.ofFn t) zs)) ∧
--         DiscL p (tensorGo (mapsGen t Aa) (List.ofFn t) zs) ∧
--         ‖wOf p t (tensorGo (mapsGen t Aa) (List.ofFn t) zs) - tensCLM (kerA L) u‖ ≤
--           d * ε * hp p
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** A lines (PR #5 block chirp), part 4: the generic `A` pass
--
--   `passGen` is `KFY1Pad.passA` with the per-axis fixed-point maps `Aa i` arbitrary: they must read
--   only the first `s_i` entries of a line (`hloc`) and be `FPApprox`es of `liftL (L i)` within `ε`
--   for line maps `‖L i‖ ≤ 1`. The list pipeline is `tensorGo (mapsGen …)`.
